{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>ויאמן</b> Twice in the Masorah: ויאמן העם and ויאמן אכיש בדוד. Two good leaders arose for Israel: Moses and David. Moses said: מחני נא. David said: תהי נא ידך בי ואלה הצאן מה עשו. Both were faithful leaders, therefore they were believed."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:54.271026846Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}